  - on its detail page, Mark under review moved it to Under review;
  - an admin not on the ride gets "Ride not found" on the form;
  - students get the "not for you" page on every admin page;
  - the ride page shows "Report a problem" for 7 days after completion.
- **Light, dark and 360 px:**
  - the form (with Safety) and the confirmation;
  - the queue and the complaint detail;
  - the rider record and the ride view.


